    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5360" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμνήμων</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμνάμων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unmindful, forgetful.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				7(6).17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				920
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				88b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>
			<i>of</i> a person or thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					606
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				1397
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				2.1.7
			</span></i>; <i>unmindful of kindness, ungrateful,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1167b27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>forgotten, not mentioned,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				64
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀμνήμονες, οἱ,</span> council of <i><span class="en">
				60
			</span></i> at Cnidus, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.292a
			</span></i>.</div>
